character: So, where do we start, PARTNER!?
steak: Hey, calm down there. I'm glad you're hyped but try to slow down a bit when speaking. It makes it sound better rather than just hollering out the words to everyone. Basic education 101.
character: Right, sorry about that.
steak: All good. You’re teaching me, I’m teaching you.
steak: Yeah! ‘Kay, so I’ll start by explaining what some of the key words mean and how we say them, yea’?
steak: Hit me.
steak: For some basic ones to start on with, you gotta know how to cut your words off to make me sound better yea’?
- Make attempt
	character: Oh so like “I am a che’.”
